WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.166
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.266 --> 00:01.336
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.336 --> 00:02.376
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.376 --> 00:03.506
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:05.046 --> 00:07.106
(Episode 30)

6
00:22.926 --> 00:23.926
Gyu Rim.

7
00:25.426 --> 00:26.496
Oh, hey, Gyu Seo.

8
00:26.896 --> 00:28.696
Do you know what time it is? What are you doing?

9
00:32.136 --> 00:33.466
Wait, you haven't slept yet?

10
00:34.336 --> 00:35.906
I just couldn't fall asleep.

11
00:37.006 --> 00:38.446
Did you come out to get some water?

12
00:40.576 --> 00:42.046
Get some sleep.

13
00:42.846 --> 00:44.046
Gyu Min told me...

14
00:44.116 --> 00:45.746
you didn't sleep a wink last night either.

15
00:47.146 --> 00:49.056
What if you pass out?

16
00:49.716 --> 00:52.356
I'm Han Gyu Rim. Do you think I'm so weak...

17
00:52.426 --> 00:54.056
that a little lost sleep will take me down?

18
00:54.486 --> 00:56.996
- Please. - What, are you made of steel?

19
00:57.226 --> 00:58.226
Didn't you know?

20
00:58.296 --> 01:00.396
Sometimes I can even fire rocket punches.

21
01:03.766 --> 01:05.006
I'll do better.

22
01:05.636 --> 01:07.636
I'll be really, really good,

23
01:08.136 --> 01:09.836
so please just forgive Gyu Oh, okay?

24
01:11.946 --> 01:13.306
No, I won't forgive him.

25
01:13.906 --> 01:15.916
In the morning, I'm going to eat three bowls of rice...

26
01:16.146 --> 01:17.476
and beat him within an inch of his life.

27
01:20.316 --> 01:21.686
If you're going to hit someone, hit me.

28
01:22.316 --> 01:23.716
Just hit me instead.

29
01:24.956 --> 01:26.986
If you're mad at Gyu Oh, take it all out on me.

30
01:27.386 --> 01:29.296
Do you think you and Gyu Min are off the hook?

31
01:30.256 --> 01:32.696
Keeping secrets from me and leaving me out...

32
01:32.826 --> 01:37.036
you two will pay for that too, so grab a switch and get ready.

33
02:12.766 --> 02:15.076
Gyu Oh. Are you okay?

34
02:17.636 --> 02:20.446
Why are you burning up? Gyu Oh.

35
02:21.176 --> 02:22.746
Gyu Oh.

36
02:24.476 --> 02:25.486
Hold on.

37
02:30.256 --> 02:31.256
Gyu Rim.

38
02:31.786 --> 02:32.886
Something's wrong with Gyu Oh.

39
02:38.726 --> 02:40.196
It's 39.2 degrees Celsius.

40
02:40.796 --> 02:42.266
Shouldn't we go to the ER?

41
02:44.466 --> 02:46.536
Gyu Oh. Han Gyu Oh.

42
02:47.206 --> 02:48.206
Gyu Oh.

43
02:50.206 --> 02:51.336
Let's go to the hospital.

44
02:52.276 --> 02:53.506
Can you sit up?

45
02:55.576 --> 02:56.646
I'm fine.

46
02:57.646 --> 02:58.646
I'm fine.

47
02:59.086 --> 03:02.916
How is this fine? You're burning up right now.

48
03:03.216 --> 03:04.856
Your fever is over 39 degrees Celsius.

49
03:05.486 --> 03:06.726
I'm not going to the hospital.

50
03:07.586 --> 03:08.626
I'm fine.

51
03:10.596 --> 03:12.596
I'll go get some fever reducers and ice water.

52
03:12.896 --> 03:13.896
Okay.

53
03:17.236 --> 03:19.506
How did the great Han Gyu Oh get sick?

54
03:20.206 --> 03:21.606
Man, why do you have to be sick?

55
03:52.936 --> 03:55.936
I'll watch him, so go get some sleep, Gyu Seo.

56
03:57.576 --> 04:00.676
I'll look after him, so you go get some shut-eye instead.

57
04:04.846 --> 04:06.216
It's already five.

58
04:06.786 --> 04:08.016
It'll be morning soon.

59
04:10.556 --> 04:12.986
Then could you go fetch a basin of cold water for me?

60
04:14.326 --> 04:15.326
Sure.

61
04:33.146 --> 04:34.406
I'm not letting you go.

62
04:35.616 --> 04:37.476
No matter what you do,

63
04:40.716 --> 04:43.056
I'm never letting you go.

64
04:50.556 --> 04:52.726
Even if the whole world abandons you,

65
04:54.766 --> 04:56.766
I'll never abandon you.

66
04:58.706 --> 05:01.436
I'll stick to you like superglue...

67
05:02.436 --> 05:04.306
and never let go,

68
05:06.146 --> 05:08.376
so get used to it, Han Gyu Oh.

69
05:38.036 --> 05:39.246
You're awake already?

70
05:48.116 --> 05:49.286
Why are you drinking...

71
05:52.056 --> 05:53.126
first thing in the morning?

72
06:01.226 --> 06:02.366
I had a dream.

73
06:04.166 --> 06:05.206
Gyu Rim was...

74
06:06.606 --> 06:08.676
She was pinned down by a massive boulder,

75
06:09.376 --> 06:11.436
suffocating and in agony.

76
06:14.646 --> 06:16.216
And I couldn't do a thing to help her.

77
06:18.816 --> 06:20.716
I couldn't even lift a finger,

78
06:22.016 --> 06:23.016
so all I could do...

79
06:23.616 --> 06:24.956
was stand there and watch.

80
06:26.126 --> 06:28.426
That's just because it was a dream. Imagine if it were real.

81
06:28.956 --> 06:30.556
You would've smashed your head against that boulder...

82
06:30.626 --> 06:32.026
to save Gyu Rim, wouldn't you?

83
06:37.266 --> 06:38.566
Forget about Gyu Rim for a second.

84
06:39.236 --> 06:40.966
Why don't we talk about you?

85
06:44.106 --> 06:45.106
You...

86
06:46.146 --> 06:47.346
You knew, didn't you?

87
06:47.746 --> 06:50.476
Who was behind Yong Cheol and Mr. Im,

88
06:50.546 --> 06:53.546
trying to ruin our restaurant. The mastermind behind it all.

89
06:55.216 --> 06:56.886
That's why you told me not to say anything...

90
06:56.956 --> 06:58.556
even if I found out who the culprit was.

91
06:58.886 --> 07:00.486
That's why you wanted to sweep it under the rug...

92
07:01.226 --> 07:02.356
and let it go, right?

93
07:16.976 --> 07:18.176
That person behind it...

94
07:21.376 --> 07:22.716
What did she say the motive was, then?

95
07:24.876 --> 07:25.916
What?

96
07:27.316 --> 07:28.856
Trampling over eight years of her son's life...

97
07:28.916 --> 07:30.186
like it was garbage...

98
07:30.516 --> 07:31.616
Pulling such crazy...

99
07:34.826 --> 07:36.096
To go as far as pulling such an absurd stunt,

100
07:36.156 --> 07:37.426
what did she say was the point?

101
07:41.366 --> 07:43.066
Keeping Gyu Rim away from me?

102
07:44.166 --> 07:46.536
Making sure I break up with her?

103
07:49.776 --> 07:50.936
Who the heck does she think I am?

104
07:51.846 --> 07:52.946
What am I?

105
07:54.006 --> 07:56.916
Just how great and wonderful of a son am I supposed to be?

106
07:57.646 --> 07:59.086
I am not worth a fraction of Gyu Rim,

107
07:59.086 --> 08:01.516
and over someone like me, why put on such an arrogant show?

108
08:02.656 --> 08:04.816
Jung Woo, I'm so humiliated. It's embarrassing.

109
08:05.326 --> 08:07.326
I'm so deeply ashamed,

110
08:07.386 --> 08:08.756
I just want to dig a hole in the ground...

111
08:08.826 --> 08:10.226
and hide away forever. Seriously.

112
08:11.996 --> 08:12.996
Jung Woo.

113
08:14.596 --> 08:16.596
She told me to give up, and I gave up everything.

114
08:17.136 --> 08:18.136
She told me to leave everything,

115
08:18.196 --> 08:19.366
so I left it all behind and walked away.

116
08:21.336 --> 08:23.206
Am I a puppet for my mother to play with?

117
08:23.306 --> 08:24.306
Is that what Kim Mu Jin is?

118
08:25.646 --> 08:26.946
Do I belong to her?

119
08:45.966 --> 08:47.796
Mom, why is Uncle sick?

120
08:48.636 --> 08:49.666
Well...

121
08:50.536 --> 08:52.936
He must be sick for a good reason, don't you think?

122
08:54.136 --> 08:55.406
What kind of reason?

123
08:58.376 --> 08:59.406
Who knows?

124
09:00.206 --> 09:01.476
I've never seen Uncle Gyu Oh...

125
09:02.076 --> 09:04.176
this sick in my entire life.

126
09:05.586 --> 09:06.686
Neither have I.

127
09:07.946 --> 09:09.216
I've never seen it either.

128
09:10.356 --> 09:11.516
What's that smell?

129
09:12.726 --> 09:13.786
Are you making black sesame porridge?

130
09:14.626 --> 09:16.956
It really is the black sesame porridge I love.

131
09:18.156 --> 09:20.196
Don't get your hopes up, Grandpa.

132
09:20.466 --> 09:22.596
She's making it because Uncle is sick.

133
09:22.596 --> 09:23.596
What?

134
09:24.736 --> 09:27.206
Gyu Oh is sick? Why is he sick?

135
09:27.566 --> 09:29.536
Probably because he has a good reason to be.

136
09:30.906 --> 09:35.376
He rarely ever gets sick, though. Even during COVID,

137
09:35.916 --> 09:38.046
when the whole family was bedridden,

138
09:38.646 --> 09:40.216
Gyu Oh was totally fine.

139
09:40.946 --> 09:43.286
Who in this world never gets sick?

140
09:43.956 --> 09:45.686
People just pretend they aren't.

141
09:49.526 --> 09:51.056
Grandpa, you always pretend to be sick...

142
09:51.126 --> 09:53.526
even when you aren't, right?

143
09:54.296 --> 09:56.366
When did I? What year, month, and day?

144
09:56.496 --> 10:00.036
- What hour, minute, and second? - August 27, 2026.

145
10:00.266 --> 10:02.636
I don't know the exact hour, minute, or second.

146
10:04.236 --> 10:05.846
Gyu Oh took medicine and went to sleep,

147
10:05.906 --> 10:07.346
so let's keep it down.

148
10:07.676 --> 10:08.816
Okay.

149
10:13.846 --> 10:17.386
Well, it's not like he's made of steel...

150
10:18.626 --> 10:19.756
He must be hurting.

151
10:21.056 --> 10:23.156
He wouldn't be human if he weren't.

152
10:35.776 --> 10:37.306
If your mom had raised you guys,

153
10:38.546 --> 10:40.006
would things have been better?

154
10:44.246 --> 10:45.416
Instead of me,

155
10:47.046 --> 10:48.856
if your mom had raised you guys,

156
10:49.886 --> 10:51.086
would you or Gyu Oh...

157
10:52.226 --> 10:53.686
be better off than now?

158
11:02.236 --> 11:03.896
Please tell me no.

159
11:06.666 --> 11:08.836
I don't think she can say no, Grandpa.

160
11:23.086 --> 11:24.886
Is his temperature back to normal now?

161
11:25.686 --> 11:29.656
No, still 37.2 degrees Celsius. It needs to drop more.

162
11:32.726 --> 11:34.366
What on earth is going on?

163
11:35.366 --> 11:37.696
I have seriously never seen Gyu Oh this sick before.

164
11:41.636 --> 11:45.346
Could he have gotten dumped?

165
11:50.046 --> 11:53.316
I'm heading to school first, so take your time coming later.

166
11:53.686 --> 11:54.946
Why? Let's go together.

167
11:56.186 --> 11:57.886
We still have 30 minutes.

168
11:59.056 --> 12:00.826
I promised to meet a friend early at school.

169
12:01.186 --> 12:02.296
See you there later.

170
12:16.406 --> 12:18.606
(7:12am)

171
12:31.786 --> 12:33.826
(8:09am)

172
12:50.606 --> 12:51.936
You remember me, right?

173
12:54.206 --> 12:56.346
Could I talk to you for a moment?

174
12:57.146 --> 12:58.846
It will really just take a minute.

175
13:03.716 --> 13:05.086
I have nothing to say to you.

176
13:07.586 --> 13:09.626
You ignored my texts, calls, and messages,

177
13:10.056 --> 13:11.196
so I had a feeling, but...

178
13:12.766 --> 13:13.896
Just ten minutes.

179
13:14.966 --> 13:16.896
Set a stopwatch, and I won't go a minute...

180
13:17.136 --> 13:20.066
no, not even 1 second over, so just 10 minutes.

181
13:20.506 --> 13:21.636
Please.

182
13:26.906 --> 13:28.206
You have two minutes left.

183
13:38.356 --> 13:40.056
Did you break up with my brother?

184
13:41.256 --> 13:42.256
Yes.

185
13:44.756 --> 13:46.096
How can love change like that?

186
13:47.896 --> 13:49.566
You said you'd never give up on him.

187
13:50.266 --> 13:53.706
You said you'd never leave him. You said if he tried to fly away,

188
13:53.806 --> 13:56.236
even if you had to break his legs, you'd keep him by your side.

189
13:56.736 --> 13:58.106
Didn't you say you wanted to marry him...

190
13:58.176 --> 13:59.746
and become part of our family?

191
14:00.146 --> 14:02.746
I was out of my mind then, like I was possessed by something.

192
14:03.976 --> 14:06.716
Now that my head is clear again...

193
14:06.716 --> 14:08.886
Then what about my brother?

194
14:09.786 --> 14:11.016
You messed with his feelings like that,

195
14:11.086 --> 14:12.456
and now you're just going to cut and run?

196
14:12.986 --> 14:14.926
Do you only keep what is sweet and spit out what is bitter?

197
14:16.326 --> 14:17.896
When things get tough, loving someone means...

198
14:17.956 --> 14:19.596
comforting and embracing them even more.

199
14:20.196 --> 14:22.366
How can love be like this?

200
14:24.896 --> 14:28.936
I thought it was love, but it's not. I never loved him.

201
14:29.876 --> 14:32.176
I already told you, I was out of my mind...

202
14:36.346 --> 14:38.346
If you are a student, focus on your studies.

203
14:39.186 --> 14:40.746
Stay out of adult business.

204
14:40.946 --> 14:42.886
My brother is in so much pain right now...

205
14:49.026 --> 14:50.556
Our ten minutes are up, right?

206
14:54.296 --> 14:55.996
Do not ever come looking for me again.

207
14:56.766 --> 14:58.806
If you run into me on the street, act like you do not know me.

208
15:37.006 --> 15:39.306
(Mom)

209
15:50.916 --> 15:52.856
Mom, have you eaten?

210
15:53.926 --> 15:55.756
That guy from back then?

211
15:56.926 --> 15:59.096
Looking closer, he seemed completely hopeless,

212
15:59.166 --> 16:00.496
so I just dumped him.

213
16:02.466 --> 16:04.036
He has nothing to his name.

214
16:07.466 --> 16:08.766
He is dirt poor.

215
16:12.076 --> 16:14.076
Sure, he is nice,

216
16:14.506 --> 16:16.116
but does being nice put food on the table?

217
16:18.116 --> 16:19.316
So, Mom,

218
16:20.486 --> 16:22.556
I am going to marry into a rich family.

219
16:25.586 --> 16:28.356
You know my brother's friend, Young Seok?

220
16:29.356 --> 16:31.596
He still calls me all the time.

221
16:32.726 --> 16:35.326
Should I just go ahead and marry him?

222
16:37.866 --> 16:41.906
His family owns tons of land and lots of buildings.

223
16:43.136 --> 16:45.076
He is known all over Andong as a rich guy.

224
16:55.286 --> 16:56.456
Are you all right?

225
16:59.486 --> 17:00.626
I am fine.

226
17:02.926 --> 17:05.326
Do you want to get up and have some porridge?

227
17:09.066 --> 17:10.996
I will sleep a little longer and get up then.

228
17:14.336 --> 17:16.806
All right, sleep more.

229
17:20.206 --> 17:22.276
Once I get a little more sleep,

230
17:25.346 --> 17:26.646
I will never fall down again.

231
17:30.086 --> 17:32.016
I swear, I will never fall down again.

232
17:35.056 --> 17:36.196
Okay.

233
17:38.356 --> 17:41.626
Even if everyone in the world tries to push me over,

234
17:44.736 --> 17:46.006
I will never fall down again.

235
17:49.736 --> 17:50.876
Okay.

236
17:53.046 --> 17:54.306
Go on out, Gyu Rim.

237
17:55.246 --> 17:56.916
I am really going to sleep now.

238
18:02.656 --> 18:03.716
Gyu Rim.

239
18:08.726 --> 18:10.156
I am worried about Hee Na.

240
18:13.796 --> 18:16.496
When I am hurting, I have you to look after me,

241
18:17.636 --> 18:19.636
and Gyu Seo and Gyu Min...

242
18:23.136 --> 18:26.346
I have so much family to lean on and hold onto.

243
18:32.346 --> 18:33.546
She has nobody.

244
18:36.716 --> 18:38.516
She has to endure it all alone.

245
18:41.786 --> 18:42.896
You are right.

246
18:45.126 --> 18:46.796
My heart breaks for her.

247
18:47.696 --> 18:48.866
Poor Hee Na.

248
19:23.566 --> 19:25.566
When I told you I respected you...

249
19:26.336 --> 19:29.576
and that you were my role model, as of today, I take it all back.

250
19:32.976 --> 19:33.976
Jung Woo.

251
19:41.546 --> 19:43.216
Just to tear a woman away from your son,

252
19:43.286 --> 19:45.256
what on earth did you do?

253
19:46.686 --> 19:48.026
How far were you planning to go?

254
19:48.886 --> 19:50.126
You were never this kind of person, ma'am.

255
19:51.126 --> 19:53.496
Did you truly not give a single thought to my feelings?

256
19:56.396 --> 19:59.466
What on earth are you talking about right now?

257
20:00.406 --> 20:01.936
I just grilled Seo Yong Cheol,

258
20:06.406 --> 20:07.546
and I came straight here...

259
20:07.606 --> 20:08.746
after hearing that you were the one...

260
20:09.576 --> 20:10.776
behind everything.

261
20:14.786 --> 20:17.616
If it is not true, tell me it is not.

262
20:18.716 --> 20:19.756
If you say it was not you,

263
20:20.756 --> 20:21.756
I will believe you entirely.

264
20:22.086 --> 20:23.396
I'll throw that bastard Seo Yong Cheol in jail...

265
20:23.556 --> 20:25.996
for defamation and false accusation.

266
20:26.296 --> 20:27.296
If it isn't true,

267
20:28.796 --> 20:30.336
please tell me it isn't.

268
20:31.136 --> 20:33.066
I'll believe you no matter what,

269
20:33.736 --> 20:34.766
so just say no.

270
20:35.936 --> 20:36.936
Say it isn't true. Just once,

271
20:38.206 --> 20:39.206
please tell me.

272
20:48.046 --> 20:49.046
Please.

273
20:51.586 --> 20:52.786
Please tell me it isn't true.

274
20:54.526 --> 20:55.826
If what Yong Cheol said is true and you did this,

275
20:56.956 --> 21:01.766
if you really orchestrated all this, forget about me, but poor Mu Jin...

276
21:04.936 --> 21:06.666
What about poor Mu Jin?

277
21:07.166 --> 21:08.166
How is that guy,

278
21:09.476 --> 21:10.906
my best friend, supposed to live?

279
21:12.506 --> 21:15.046
How is your son supposed to breathe,

280
21:15.146 --> 21:16.446
and how is he supposed to go on living?

281
21:22.246 --> 21:23.486
Please tell me it isn't true, ma'am.

282
21:37.766 --> 21:40.636
(Mu Jin)

283
22:00.786 --> 22:02.696
(Mother)

284
22:13.406 --> 22:14.436
When are you coming?

285
22:19.176 --> 22:21.046
When are you coming to grab your mother by the collar?

286
22:23.346 --> 22:25.176
I'll deal with you anytime,

287
22:26.116 --> 22:27.216
so come over whenever you want.

288
22:30.256 --> 22:31.256
Hello?

289
22:32.116 --> 22:33.426
Who am I talking to?

290
22:35.126 --> 22:36.156
Can't you speak?

291
22:36.926 --> 22:38.196
Did you lose your voice?

292
22:42.096 --> 22:43.966
Hello? Mu Jin. Kim Mu Jin.

293
22:49.066 --> 22:50.076
Unbelievable.

294
22:52.776 --> 22:54.376
Did this punk just hang up on his mother?

295
22:55.576 --> 22:57.176
Seriously, what?

296
22:57.716 --> 22:59.246
Are you cutting ties with me now?

297
23:02.446 --> 23:03.556
Fine, I can just...

298
23:04.786 --> 23:06.526
act like I don't have a son.

299
23:08.856 --> 23:09.856
That punk.

300
23:12.596 --> 23:14.126
I can pretend I never gave birth to him.

301
23:49.566 --> 23:52.366
(Suragan Side Dishes)

302
23:53.436 --> 23:57.536
Did something I ate for lunch disagree with me? What is this?

303
24:07.686 --> 24:08.916
It's you, right?

304
24:09.686 --> 24:12.886
You're the one who sneaks around...

305
24:13.286 --> 24:16.026
peeing right here, aren't you?

306
24:17.196 --> 24:19.896
Acting like that makes you look even more suspicious.

307
24:20.366 --> 24:23.536
If it wasn't you, say so, and let me see your face.

308
24:23.736 --> 24:28.436
Show me your face. I caught the culprit.

309
24:29.166 --> 24:33.506
That scoundrel who's always peeing on our wall...

310
24:33.576 --> 24:36.216
I just caught him red-handed.

311
24:39.346 --> 24:41.786
That can't be. On the security camera,

312
24:41.846 --> 24:45.986
the culprit was huge, remember? And that is why you said...

313
24:46.086 --> 24:47.426
that we'd have to catch him like a gorilla,

314
24:47.486 --> 24:50.726
by throwing a net over him to capture him, ma'am.

315
24:51.226 --> 24:52.726
Is that so?

316
24:54.426 --> 24:56.466
Then who is this?

317
24:56.966 --> 25:00.666
Who knows? Just some random passerby?

318
25:01.036 --> 25:04.536
Then why turn away so suspiciously the moment you see someone?

319
25:05.836 --> 25:09.476
Hey, do you owe me money or something?

320
25:10.516 --> 25:12.346
Why are you squirming like that?

321
25:12.676 --> 25:16.516
When an elder is talking to you, you look them in the eye and speak.

322
25:16.816 --> 25:20.856
Hey, look at me. Look at me, I said.

323
25:20.956 --> 25:24.156
Ma'am, don't you urgently need the bathroom?

324
25:24.326 --> 25:25.756
How did you know?

325
25:25.826 --> 25:27.896
Wait, I have to go right now. Keep a close watch!

326
25:37.476 --> 25:40.306
(Jameon Medical Supplies)

327
25:43.076 --> 25:44.076
Welcome.

328
25:50.386 --> 25:51.556
I'm Han Gyu Young.

329
25:51.916 --> 25:53.726
Yes. How can I help you?

330
25:54.926 --> 25:57.396
Well, that side-dish shop over there,

331
25:57.996 --> 26:00.166
have you seen any strange people coming and going by any chance?

332
26:00.466 --> 26:02.026
He is really tall,

333
26:02.196 --> 26:03.936
and he looks like a vicious psychopath.

334
26:04.366 --> 26:05.566
Well, I don't really pay...

335
26:05.966 --> 26:09.676
much attention to the customers coming to the side-dish shop.

336
26:12.506 --> 26:14.476
Please pay close attention from now on.

337
26:14.846 --> 26:17.046
Someone's life might be on the line here.

338
26:17.346 --> 26:21.116
What? Whose life? Do you mean Gyu Rim?

339
26:21.186 --> 26:22.186
Yes.

340
26:24.456 --> 26:25.686
Please give me your number.

341
26:27.186 --> 26:29.556
I'll send you a photo,

342
26:29.756 --> 26:31.056
and if a guy who looks like that shows up,

343
26:31.126 --> 26:32.126
let me know right away...

344
26:33.696 --> 26:35.366
My phone is almost always turned off,

345
26:36.196 --> 26:37.796
so text Jo Heung Sik...

346
26:38.966 --> 26:41.606
the word "PS."

347
26:42.636 --> 26:44.606
Wait, did you say "PS"?

348
26:46.376 --> 26:47.506
It means psychopath sighting.

349
26:50.446 --> 26:53.786
Don't tell Grandmother Su Nam or Han Gyu Rim...

350
26:54.086 --> 26:55.446
that you saw me.

351
26:56.986 --> 26:57.986
PS.

352
27:36.056 --> 27:37.056
Hello.

353
27:40.196 --> 27:41.196
Mu Jin.

354
27:43.236 --> 27:44.566
Were you peeling potatoes?

355
27:45.796 --> 27:46.806
Yes.

356
27:49.036 --> 27:50.976
How is Gyu Oh doing?

357
27:56.076 --> 27:57.416
He's getting through it.

358
28:00.286 --> 28:01.286
What about you?

359
28:04.486 --> 28:05.486
Me too.

360
28:11.826 --> 28:12.856
By the way...

361
28:13.426 --> 28:14.496
Aren't you busy?

362
28:16.366 --> 28:17.396
No, I'm not busy.

363
28:18.396 --> 28:19.606
I only do dinner service now.

364
28:20.536 --> 28:21.766
Plus, today is our regular day off.

365
28:25.336 --> 28:27.246
- Gyu Rim. - Yes?

366
28:32.076 --> 28:33.486
What does it mean to be a parent and child?

367
28:36.456 --> 28:37.486
I was just...

368
28:38.456 --> 28:39.856
curious all of a sudden.

369
28:51.196 --> 28:52.766
If both...

370
28:53.436 --> 28:56.376
you and Gyeol were drowning in water.

371
28:56.676 --> 28:57.676
Yes.

372
28:59.036 --> 29:02.276
I would without question save our Gyeol first.

373
29:08.246 --> 29:09.246
That's fine.

374
29:09.886 --> 29:11.016
I'm a good swimmer.

375
29:11.786 --> 29:12.856
A really good one.

376
29:14.326 --> 29:17.326
Did I ever tell you that my nickname growing up was "The Seal"?

377
29:22.666 --> 29:24.666
Say there's a delicious dish,

378
29:24.736 --> 29:27.506
- the only one in the entire world. - Yes.

379
29:27.566 --> 29:29.736
And both you and Gyeol...

380
29:29.806 --> 29:32.206
- really, really wanted to eat it. - Yes.

381
29:32.376 --> 29:35.576
I wouldn't think twice, and I'd give it to Gyeol.

382
29:39.916 --> 29:41.486
Hey, I'm a chef.

383
29:41.886 --> 29:44.286
Do you really think there's any food in this world that I haven't tried?

384
29:44.486 --> 29:47.826
Just give it all to Gyeol. I can just get the recipe...

385
29:47.886 --> 29:50.396
and make the exact same thing myself.

386
29:51.396 --> 29:54.726
Say I am carrying both you and Gyeol on my back.

387
29:55.266 --> 29:56.936
Then, right in front of us,

388
29:57.166 --> 29:59.236
- a huge swamp appears. - Yes?

389
29:59.296 --> 30:01.166
And terrifying crocodiles live there.

390
30:01.236 --> 30:03.776
- Right. - I am exhausted,

391
30:03.836 --> 30:06.176
so I cannot carry you both anymore.

392
30:06.906 --> 30:10.276
I have to put at least one down to save the other.

393
30:10.546 --> 30:11.676
Put Gyeol down...

394
30:14.616 --> 30:17.186
Of course you should put me down. Because I am...

395
30:17.456 --> 30:18.586
much heavier.

396
30:19.156 --> 30:22.126
Right. I would gladly put you down...

397
30:22.186 --> 30:23.726
and save our Gyeol.

398
30:28.566 --> 30:30.896
Well, of course you should.

399
30:32.196 --> 30:35.306
I have lived long enough, while Gyeol has...

400
30:35.366 --> 30:38.406
a long life ahead of him, and he is still so fragile.

401
30:39.946 --> 30:41.846
That is how it is between parents and children.

402
30:44.776 --> 30:48.016
You might sulk and feel hurt,

403
30:48.546 --> 30:50.256
but that is how a mother and son are.

404
30:59.996 --> 31:02.366
Not every mother and son in the world are like that.

405
31:05.596 --> 31:08.636
They just express it differently. Deep down, they all feel the same.

406
31:10.536 --> 31:11.936
Even your mother.

407
31:30.126 --> 31:31.326
Just one more drink.

408
31:32.626 --> 31:33.626
Forget it.

409
31:34.196 --> 31:36.066
Do you think this is a bar? That is your third glass.

410
31:37.366 --> 31:40.436
Just one more. I will buy you a whole case later,

411
31:40.506 --> 31:43.276
- so just give me one more. - Forget it. No.

412
31:44.776 --> 31:47.346
Hey. You are so petty.

413
31:47.576 --> 31:49.676
Do you think I cannot drink without you?

414
31:50.346 --> 31:51.416
Are you out of your mind?

415
31:52.616 --> 31:54.116
You drive me crazy, seriously.

416
31:54.986 --> 31:56.716
First you said we were done and never wanted to see me,

417
31:56.786 --> 31:58.786
and now you burst in while I am working.

418
31:58.916 --> 32:02.026
You are so unpredictable. None of this makes sense.

419
32:02.156 --> 32:03.396
When I look at you,

420
32:03.956 --> 32:05.796
I realise that stubborn streak of Mu Jin's...

421
32:05.856 --> 32:07.126
comes straight from you.

422
32:07.696 --> 32:10.166
- Are you badmouthing my son? - Why?

423
32:10.366 --> 32:11.866
Does it upset you when I badmouth your son?

424
32:12.396 --> 32:13.406
Sit down.

425
32:13.466 --> 32:15.706
Why should I? You will not even give me a drink.

426
32:15.766 --> 32:18.436
Just sit. Instead of a drink, I will praise you.

427
32:20.276 --> 32:22.346
Hurry up. Hey.

428
32:23.146 --> 32:24.746
I heard all about it from Yoon Jin.

429
32:25.646 --> 32:26.746
You did well.

430
32:26.946 --> 32:28.786
Because you hit the brakes, even if it was late.

431
32:29.486 --> 32:32.616
I really thought you were turning into a monster.

432
32:32.886 --> 32:35.726
It could have been worse. Hong Ok Seon.

433
32:36.156 --> 32:37.256
Good job.

434
32:42.366 --> 32:44.796
Hey. Be honest with me.

435
32:45.836 --> 32:48.266
Do you admit you were acting a little strange?

436
32:49.106 --> 32:51.106
That you were half crazy?

437
32:51.176 --> 32:53.606
- Admit you were out of your mind. - Hey.

438
32:53.676 --> 32:57.146
Just admit it. Admit it, and go out right now...

439
32:57.546 --> 33:00.516
to Mu Jin. Go see Mu Jin...

440
33:01.086 --> 33:03.656
and beg for his forgiveness. You need to apologize sincerely...

441
33:03.916 --> 33:06.826
and ask him to forgive you. Do you understand?

442
33:07.356 --> 33:09.326
Accept Gyu Rim too...

443
33:10.096 --> 33:12.926
and stop breaking those kids' hearts.

444
33:12.996 --> 33:15.126
Does being a parent make you royalty?

445
33:15.266 --> 33:17.436
Did you save the country or something to become a parent?

446
33:17.936 --> 33:19.536
Why did I even come here?

447
33:20.166 --> 33:21.736
To listen to this nag...

448
33:21.806 --> 33:22.966
Why did I come?

449
33:23.036 --> 33:24.576
Hey, if you keep having that attitude,

450
33:24.636 --> 33:25.736
I will really not hang out with you.

451
33:25.806 --> 33:26.906
I will stop seeing you.

452
33:27.846 --> 33:29.706
- Hey. - What?

453
33:29.776 --> 33:32.416
Fine, do not see me. Do not hang out with me.

454
33:32.476 --> 33:34.586
I have other people to hang out with, you know.

455
33:34.646 --> 33:36.246
- You do? - Yes.

456
33:36.316 --> 33:37.756
- Really? - I do.

457
33:39.186 --> 33:42.186
See? My phone is ringing. I told you so.

458
33:44.456 --> 33:45.826
(Mu Jin)

459
33:46.696 --> 33:47.696
Answer it.

460
33:48.126 --> 33:50.066
Why are you not picking up? Are you playing hard to get?

461
33:50.166 --> 33:51.166
Who is it?

462
33:56.976 --> 33:57.976
Gosh...

463
34:00.246 --> 34:01.246
Hello.

464
34:06.246 --> 34:07.716
Did you call the wrong number?

465
34:10.686 --> 34:12.586
After hanging up on me without saying a single word?

466
34:15.956 --> 34:17.026
Please come over.

467
34:18.956 --> 34:20.066
What? Where?

468
34:20.796 --> 34:22.226
To my restaurant.

469
34:23.736 --> 34:24.896
Please come.

470
34:29.566 --> 34:30.876
I will be waiting.

471
34:34.346 --> 34:36.076
Mu Jin? Mu Jin...

472
34:37.346 --> 34:38.446
What is it? Was that Mu Jin?

473
34:38.516 --> 34:40.016
What did he say? Does he want to meet?

474
34:42.586 --> 34:44.186
- Hey. - What? What is it?

475
34:44.256 --> 34:46.586
- What is his deal? - Why?

476
34:47.226 --> 34:50.296
Why is he summoning me to his home turf?

477
34:50.656 --> 34:53.626
Is he really planning to take me out or something?

478
34:55.126 --> 34:56.896
Take you out?

479
34:57.896 --> 34:59.796
Why would a son take out his own mother?

480
34:59.866 --> 35:01.336
What kind of movies have you been watching lately?

481
35:01.636 --> 35:04.176
What is wrong with you? You were never like this.

482
35:04.706 --> 35:05.936
Are you acting like this...

483
35:06.006 --> 35:07.076
because of that sparkling water guy?

484
35:08.506 --> 35:10.116
Yes, I bet that is it.

485
35:10.946 --> 35:11.946
Hurry up and go.

486
35:12.716 --> 35:13.846
Go on, hurry.

487
35:30.066 --> 35:33.166
- Enjoy them. - Thank you. I will enjoy them.

488
35:33.236 --> 35:35.436
- Have a great day. - You too.

489
35:43.076 --> 35:45.616
Thanks to you, Mu Jin, we are almost done peeling.

490
35:46.246 --> 35:47.746
I do not know if I should really be...

491
35:47.816 --> 35:49.946
ordering around our precious Chef Kim like this.

492
35:52.216 --> 35:54.056
- Earlier... - Yes?

493
35:54.826 --> 35:55.956
Even if you had left me...

494
35:57.096 --> 35:58.956
in a swamp full of crocodiles,

495
36:01.326 --> 36:03.266
once you got Gyeol to safety,

496
36:04.666 --> 36:08.566
you'd feel guilty and return to the swamp to find me.

497
36:08.906 --> 36:09.906
And then,

498
36:10.506 --> 36:13.576
you'd walk into the swamp and die right alongside me.

499
36:14.546 --> 36:15.546
Am I wrong?

500
36:16.176 --> 36:18.416
Are you still dwelling on that?

501
36:20.546 --> 36:21.886
You're wrong.

502
36:22.816 --> 36:24.186
Don't lie.

503
36:25.186 --> 36:26.256
Don't you think I know you?

504
36:28.126 --> 36:30.326
Either way, don't ever come back trying to save me.

505
36:30.656 --> 36:33.226
Don't let my sacrifice go to waste. Seriously.

506
36:36.466 --> 36:38.866
It's not like we're Romeo and Juliet...

507
36:39.396 --> 36:42.006
Even if I get eaten alive by crocodiles,

508
36:42.066 --> 36:45.136
you need to live a long, happy life,

509
36:45.206 --> 36:48.606
being looked after by Gyeol for the rest of your days.

510
36:49.046 --> 36:51.346
Granted, you might not be happy because I died first.

511
36:51.416 --> 36:54.416
Still, that's how you have to live, okay?

512
36:55.346 --> 36:59.516
- Only then can I rest in peace. - Why are you being so serious?

513
36:59.856 --> 37:02.326
It was just a hypothetical.

514
37:04.696 --> 37:08.526
You're just too nice. You're so good and kind...

515
37:08.596 --> 37:12.166
that you don't seem to have a single selfish bone in your body.

516
37:12.236 --> 37:16.106
You're so absurdly good that I'm constantly worried about you.

517
37:16.206 --> 37:18.136
I can barely sleep at night lately.

518
37:22.276 --> 37:26.916
Instead of dying together, I'll slay the crocodiles...

519
37:26.986 --> 37:31.386
and save you, Mu Jin. Then you, Gyeol, and I...

520
37:31.456 --> 37:34.486
can live happily ever after, the three of us,

521
37:34.556 --> 37:37.596
until the end of the world. We'll stay together.

522
37:38.126 --> 37:39.196
Happy now?

523
37:40.866 --> 37:44.066
All I'm saying is, don't be such a pushover.

524
37:44.296 --> 37:46.736
Not everyone in this world has a good heart like yours.

525
37:50.576 --> 37:55.106
Hey, don't just eat plain porridge. Have some side dishes with it.

526
37:56.376 --> 37:58.716
- I'll get you some water kimchi. - I'm fine.

527
38:03.486 --> 38:04.486
Gyu Oh.

528
38:06.586 --> 38:08.456
Isn't Gyeol's teacher visiting you?

529
38:12.356 --> 38:16.296
How will you ever meet a woman like a teacher again?

530
38:17.236 --> 38:21.166
No matter what she says, just hold on to her.

531
38:24.436 --> 38:28.876
Beg her in tears, and if she still wants to leave, then just...

532
38:29.946 --> 38:31.376
Tell her to kill you instead.

533
38:31.976 --> 38:32.976
No, wait.

534
38:33.046 --> 38:36.116
- Tell her you'll die together. - What am I, a thug?

535
38:38.116 --> 38:39.156
She left already, didn't she?

536
38:39.656 --> 38:41.826
She dumped you and left.

537
38:44.956 --> 38:47.496
Right, that's why you're sick.

538
38:49.796 --> 38:51.966
Should I go beg her?

539
38:52.036 --> 38:53.706
Beg her to give my son another chance?

540
38:54.236 --> 38:55.666
If she takes you back just once,

541
38:55.736 --> 38:56.766
I swear I won't give her a hard time...

542
38:56.836 --> 38:58.436
and I will treat her like a queen.

543
38:58.506 --> 39:00.976
Should I get on my knees and beg? Should I really?

544
39:07.646 --> 39:08.646
What a shame.

545
39:13.686 --> 39:14.686
You know who I am, right?

546
39:16.286 --> 39:17.526
No, I do not.

547
39:18.526 --> 39:19.656
If it's not Kwon Hee Na,

548
39:20.126 --> 39:21.366
I don't care who it is.

549
39:22.326 --> 39:24.296
You are mine. I am going to love you.

550
39:26.036 --> 39:27.066
I'm the one who will love you.

551
39:28.136 --> 39:29.536
Have you heard of someone turning to stone from waiting?

552
39:30.206 --> 39:32.506
I almost turned into a stone waiting for you.

553
39:32.876 --> 39:34.246
So how are you going to take responsibility?

554
39:39.976 --> 39:41.246
I was a host bar worker.

555
39:42.286 --> 39:43.286
That is past tense.

556
39:43.816 --> 39:46.356
It is not in the present tense. So what is it now?

557
39:46.816 --> 39:49.786
Is it "Han Gyu Oh loved Kwon Hee Na"?

558
39:50.456 --> 39:51.456
Or "loves"?

559
39:52.056 --> 39:54.426
I love you. Present tense.

560
39:55.066 --> 39:57.866
Kwon Hee Na and Han Gyu Oh are getting married today.

561
39:59.336 --> 40:00.706
Until the day I die,

562
40:00.766 --> 40:02.406
I will protect Hee Na and her family,

563
40:03.106 --> 40:06.436
respect them, and live loving her more than myself.

564
40:06.506 --> 40:08.476
(Hee Na)

565
40:11.776 --> 40:13.916
(No Results Found)

566
41:01.096 --> 41:02.096
Han Gyu Oh.

567
41:05.366 --> 41:07.566
Did you see a ghost? Why are you so startled?

568
41:07.736 --> 41:09.636
I thought you could not make it today.

569
41:10.106 --> 41:11.276
I never said that.

570
41:11.576 --> 41:14.646
Well, Gyu Min called me this morning.

571
41:15.906 --> 41:16.906
Are you hiding something?

572
41:17.676 --> 41:19.516
Why are you acting shady? You are even stuttering.

573
41:21.516 --> 41:24.056
Just go home. Go home and rest today.

574
41:24.256 --> 41:25.556
I thought you were sick all night.

575
41:27.256 --> 41:28.256
I am all better.

576
41:37.636 --> 41:38.636
Seo Min Ju.

577
41:41.066 --> 41:42.936
She said she just stopped by to see me.

578
41:47.076 --> 41:48.076
As you know,

579
41:48.406 --> 41:49.946
I am not great at keeping my temper in check.

580
41:50.816 --> 41:52.576
When I am pissed, I do not care if you are a man or a woman.

581
41:53.416 --> 41:54.886
Get lost before I do something worse.

582
41:58.916 --> 42:00.216
You are just a cheap gigolo.

583
42:01.986 --> 42:03.586
You tricked my mom, conned her,

584
42:03.956 --> 42:05.896
and ripped her off. You are a criminal.

585
42:06.526 --> 42:10.266
Because of you, my mom right now cannot sleep or eat...

586
42:10.636 --> 42:12.696
and is even seeing a psychiatrist for her anger.

587
42:13.936 --> 42:15.336
The scumbag who put my mom through that...

588
42:15.406 --> 42:17.336
has no right to shamelessly live happily ever after.

589
42:18.906 --> 42:20.506
If you commit a crime, you should be punished.

590
42:21.906 --> 42:24.246
You should suffer as much as my mom did.

591
42:25.046 --> 42:26.046
Do you not know who I am?

592
42:26.876 --> 42:28.146
Did you think I would find out everything...

593
42:28.846 --> 42:31.186
and just shut my mouth, pretending not to know?

594
42:32.216 --> 42:34.026
Did you think I would let you be happy alone?

595
42:37.126 --> 42:38.126
Fine.

596
42:39.226 --> 42:40.826
A piece of trash like me deserves to be punished.

597
42:41.326 --> 42:44.296
I should never be happy. I should never live a good life.

598
42:44.936 --> 42:46.436
Nothing you said is wrong.

599
42:49.036 --> 42:50.266
But why go after Hee Na?

600
42:51.406 --> 42:52.806
What?

601
42:53.176 --> 42:55.006
Why go after poor Hee Na?

602
42:56.106 --> 42:57.476
What did she ever do wrong?

603
42:58.276 --> 43:02.346
She is a victim because of me, too. So why drag poor Hee Na into this?

604
43:08.556 --> 43:10.756
(Han Gyu Oh, Han Gyu Oh)

605
43:17.126 --> 43:19.266
Come on, just give me Gyeol's teacher's number.

606
43:19.696 --> 43:21.036
I will go beg for forgiveness myself.

607
43:21.466 --> 43:24.536
Please just stay out of it for now and do nothing, Father.

608
43:24.776 --> 43:26.736
And do not ever bring up Ms. Kwon to Gyu Oh either.

609
43:27.006 --> 43:30.006
You all used to complain that I never cared about you.

610
43:30.076 --> 43:31.216
I put these on the wrong feet.

611
43:32.376 --> 43:34.746
Now you are mad at me for actually caring?

612
43:35.216 --> 43:36.216
I just want to act like a father...

613
43:36.286 --> 43:39.516
- for once in my life. - Father, I am a bit busy right now.

614
43:39.586 --> 43:41.786
I will call you back later, okay?

615
43:44.256 --> 43:45.256
Was that Dad?

616
43:45.726 --> 43:46.726
What does he want now?

617
43:47.366 --> 43:48.396
Nothing, never mind.

618
43:48.996 --> 43:51.466
Did you two come straight here instead of going home?

619
43:51.766 --> 43:52.766
Yes.

620
43:55.466 --> 43:57.806
Didn't you say you hired a helper?

621
43:58.436 --> 43:59.736
Why are you working all by yourself?

622
44:00.036 --> 44:02.206
She had to step out for an errand.

623
44:02.476 --> 44:03.476
I see.

624
44:04.546 --> 44:06.316
Ta-da. A gift for you.

625
44:06.616 --> 44:09.086
What is this? A gift out of nowhere?

626
44:09.646 --> 44:10.656
Take it, Gyu Rim.

627
44:10.856 --> 44:12.286
It is the cosmetics Gyu Seo modelled for,

628
44:12.356 --> 44:13.986
and he bought it with his own money.

629
44:14.426 --> 44:16.126
You haven't been sleeping well lately,

630
44:16.186 --> 44:17.796
and your skin looks totally dry.

631
44:19.526 --> 44:22.196
How could you afford this? Why did you buy it?

632
44:22.496 --> 44:24.436
I have enough to buy you cosmetics.

633
44:26.536 --> 44:29.506
I tried a little bit of it at the store earlier.

634
44:30.206 --> 44:31.206
Look at this.

635
44:35.406 --> 44:36.406
Ta-da.

636
44:39.316 --> 44:40.376
Doesn't it look so moisturized?

637
44:44.856 --> 44:45.856
Ta-da.

638
44:45.986 --> 44:49.886
- Doesn't it look so much brighter? - It looks amazing.

639
44:51.526 --> 44:52.696
Thank you, Gyu Seo.

640
44:53.526 --> 44:54.796
- We just want you... - We just want you...

641
44:54.796 --> 44:56.096
- to bloom like a flower. - to bloom like a flower.

642
44:57.096 --> 44:58.096
- No way, - No way,

643
44:58.096 --> 44:59.496
- you were thinking that, too? - you were thinking that, too?

644
45:01.306 --> 45:02.306
Let me say it first.

645
45:04.076 --> 45:07.576
Stop worrying about the family, use good skincare products,

646
45:07.746 --> 45:09.046
and blossom like your beautiful face.

647
45:10.106 --> 45:13.876
Oh, my gosh, this is insane. I was literally about to say...

648
45:13.946 --> 45:15.446
the exact same thing, word for word.

649
45:16.246 --> 45:18.786
Do we need to spend some time apart?

650
45:21.526 --> 45:22.526
Come here.

651
45:27.596 --> 45:31.196
What would I have done without you twins?

652
45:32.966 --> 45:34.466
Thank you for being born.

653
45:35.236 --> 45:36.866
Gyu Seo, Gyu Min.

654
45:37.536 --> 45:39.906
Thank you so much for being my siblings.

655
45:52.586 --> 45:54.056
This meat tastes heavenly.

656
45:54.126 --> 45:56.256
Here is the extra meat you ordered.

657
45:56.356 --> 45:58.096
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

658
45:59.396 --> 46:01.466
They said the owner stepped out to the bank,

659
46:01.526 --> 46:02.666
so why is it taking so long?

660
46:02.926 --> 46:04.996
I am not sure. I just got here myself.

661
46:05.736 --> 46:07.136
Why are you looking for her anyway?

662
46:07.266 --> 46:09.436
If you have something to say, you can tell me.

663
46:11.006 --> 46:13.306
This is not something I can discuss with a girl like you.

664
46:13.536 --> 46:17.416
It is something I need to hash out with the owner while pulling hair,

665
46:17.616 --> 46:18.616
so mind your own...

666
46:21.646 --> 46:22.916
Pull her hair?

667
46:25.486 --> 46:27.826
Did my mom cheat you out of money or something?

668
46:28.726 --> 46:29.886
What did my mom ever do to you?

669
46:31.656 --> 46:34.326
Yoon Hee is your mother? Why?

670
46:34.596 --> 46:35.666
What do you mean, why?

671
46:35.666 --> 46:37.736
She is my mother, and I am her daughter.

672
46:40.706 --> 46:44.706
- Are you Gyu Young by any chance? - No, I am not. I am Jang Seo Hyun.

673
46:45.076 --> 46:46.076
Seo Hyun.

674
46:46.836 --> 46:49.076
Mom, do you know this woman?

675
46:50.306 --> 46:51.976
Why are you here instead of at work?

676
46:52.516 --> 46:56.746
- Because it is my day off. - She says she is your daughter.

677
46:57.816 --> 47:00.256
She looks about Gyu Rim's age, give or take a year or two.

678
47:01.226 --> 47:02.956
Please tell me you did not give birth to her.

679
47:03.386 --> 47:05.326
You did not cheat on him too, did you?

680
47:05.596 --> 47:07.896
Who do you think you are, lady? Seriously.

681
47:10.566 --> 47:12.396
Your new husband's daughter?

682
47:16.266 --> 47:17.406
Why are you here?

683
47:17.906 --> 47:20.776
You were blowing off my calls, so I came in person. Got a problem?

684
47:21.246 --> 47:23.576
Mom, do you know this woman?

685
47:25.116 --> 47:26.316
I will answer your calls.

686
47:26.946 --> 47:27.946
I will answer them,

687
47:28.016 --> 47:30.146
so let us talk over the phone and please leave.

688
47:31.686 --> 47:34.456
I have not even eaten my meat yet. I still have alcohol left too.

689
47:35.056 --> 47:38.496
If I am making a scene, I am doing it here.

690
47:40.296 --> 47:41.296
Ji Hee.

691
47:44.236 --> 47:45.496
Why are you taking my drink?

692
47:46.496 --> 47:48.906
I will give you an unopened bottle, so take it home and drink there.

693
47:49.536 --> 47:52.576
I will wrap up the leftover meat too, so just take it.

694
47:52.576 --> 47:53.676
It is on the house.

695
47:54.306 --> 47:58.276
Do you think I took the subway and transferred to a bus...

696
47:58.346 --> 48:00.076
all the way out here just to walk away?

697
48:01.646 --> 48:02.916
I have a business to run.

698
48:03.546 --> 48:05.986
So let us talk later in private...

699
48:06.056 --> 48:09.626
I came here to get something straight.

700
48:13.356 --> 48:16.196
Do you still have feelings for Seok Joong?

701
48:18.496 --> 48:21.436
Do you want to get back together with your ex-husband?

702
48:22.136 --> 48:23.136
What?

703
48:24.006 --> 48:26.576
Then why do you keep bringing up the past?

704
48:27.136 --> 48:28.806
Why are you still interrogating me...

705
48:28.876 --> 48:31.116
about how I treated your kids after all this time?

706
48:31.976 --> 48:34.216
Why? Is your new husband giving you grief?

707
48:34.716 --> 48:37.416
Do you want to play mom again to Gyu Rim, Gyu Young, and Gyu Oh?

708
48:37.416 --> 48:38.516
Hey, lady!

709
48:42.586 --> 48:45.626
I told you I want Seok Joong back.

710
48:45.626 --> 48:47.496
Are you jealous?

711
48:47.826 --> 48:49.066
Listen to this woman.

712
48:49.196 --> 48:50.766
Do you think you can just say whatever you want?

713
48:51.166 --> 48:54.036
- Is that it? - Later.

714
48:54.666 --> 48:56.636
Step outside. Let us talk outside.

715
48:57.306 --> 49:00.106
No way. Are you going to hit me out there?

716
49:00.706 --> 49:03.006
Hit her, Mom. Hit her if you want to.

717
49:03.076 --> 49:04.376
I will keep watch. Hit her.

718
49:04.676 --> 49:05.676
What?

719
49:06.176 --> 49:08.746
How dare you talk to an adult like that?

720
49:09.516 --> 49:11.156
Is that how your parents raised you?

721
49:11.456 --> 49:14.586
Let go. Get off her. Don't you dare touch her.

722
49:14.656 --> 49:17.726
No. My mother taught me to forgive and be patient...

723
49:17.796 --> 49:19.696
no matter how unfair things get,

724
49:19.856 --> 49:22.696
but with someone like you, I cannot take it anymore.

725
49:22.866 --> 49:25.266
I'm holding back from punching you...

726
49:25.266 --> 49:28.236
- and bloodying your nose. - What, brat?

727
49:29.906 --> 49:30.936
Seo Hyun.

728
49:33.076 --> 49:34.346
Don't you dare touch her.

729
49:35.806 --> 49:38.146
Don't you dare lay a finger on my precious daughter.

730
49:39.946 --> 49:42.846
Let go of me. All the customers are staring.

731
49:43.816 --> 49:45.786
What kind of owner grabs a customer by the collar...

732
49:45.916 --> 49:48.726
and makes a scene so people can't even eat?

733
49:51.426 --> 49:54.196
I said let go.

734
49:55.426 --> 49:57.526
You are so small, so why are you so strong?

735
49:57.636 --> 49:59.666
Everyone is watching.

736
50:01.166 --> 50:02.766
I am sorry, everyone.

737
50:03.936 --> 50:06.536
I tried with all my might to hold it in,

738
50:07.306 --> 50:09.106
but I just couldn't take it anymore.

739
50:11.676 --> 50:13.616
This woman is my friend's younger sister.

740
50:14.586 --> 50:16.716
She seduced a married man with three kids,

741
50:17.656 --> 50:20.956
kicked me out, and set up a home with my husband.

742
50:21.226 --> 50:24.996
- Are you crazy? - I was going to let him go...

743
50:25.126 --> 50:26.156
since he is a scumbag anyway,

744
50:27.026 --> 50:28.666
and for the sake of my children,

745
50:29.366 --> 50:31.996
I tried desperately to move on with my life,

746
50:34.066 --> 50:36.366
but I just couldn't hold it back.

747
50:38.636 --> 50:41.176
Let go. Let go of me.

748
50:41.306 --> 50:43.606
Have you no shame? Have you completely lost your mind?

749
50:43.746 --> 50:47.046
Darn it, this is so embarrassing. Do you want to stay in business?

750
50:47.146 --> 50:49.046
Do you want to close down your restaurant?

751
50:52.416 --> 50:54.216
She has really lost it.

752
51:08.636 --> 51:10.336
I am so sorry, everyone.

753
51:11.506 --> 51:13.236
I am truly, deeply sorry.

754
51:15.476 --> 51:17.506
Ruining your meals like this...

755
51:19.876 --> 51:21.446
I am so terribly sorry.

756
51:27.356 --> 51:28.656
First thing in the morning,

757
51:28.826 --> 51:30.656
you should go see a psychiatrist, ma'am.

758
51:35.496 --> 51:36.726
Ma'am.

759
51:36.796 --> 51:38.436
You wretched woman, curse you to ruin.

760
51:43.636 --> 51:44.876
It is all right, ma'am.

761
51:46.236 --> 51:47.276
You did the right thing.

762
51:50.106 --> 51:51.876
I am sorry, everyone.

763
51:52.846 --> 51:56.586
I am so terribly sorry. I am sorry.

764
51:56.846 --> 51:59.786
It is okay. Don't cry. It is all right.

765
52:08.796 --> 52:10.066
I am sorry.

766
52:23.506 --> 52:27.986
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

767
52:28.386 --> 52:30.246
Should I call Mu Jin and tell him we arrived?

768
52:31.616 --> 52:34.856
No. Wait a second. Let me take a deep breath.

769
52:35.686 --> 52:37.056
Don't be so nervous.

770
52:37.426 --> 52:39.356
It isn't like Mu Jin is going to kill you.

771
52:40.426 --> 52:42.666
Hey, he just might.

772
52:43.096 --> 52:45.036
That kid takes after me. Once he snaps...

773
52:45.866 --> 52:47.736
So there is no telling what might happen.

774
52:48.166 --> 52:50.236
You stay glued to my side today, okay?

775
52:51.036 --> 52:52.536
Stay right next to me. Right...

776
53:09.456 --> 53:10.886
Was traffic bad?

777
53:12.696 --> 53:14.596
- Where is Jung Woo? - He did not come in.

778
53:14.796 --> 53:16.996
We are closed today.

779
53:17.396 --> 53:18.936
I see.

780
53:21.036 --> 53:22.036
Mu Jin.

781
53:22.736 --> 53:25.606
Hey. I will hail a cab for Mother later.

782
53:25.876 --> 53:29.676
- You go on home. - Why? Yoon Jin should come in too.

783
53:30.546 --> 53:32.246
I want to talk to you alone today, Mother.

784
53:33.016 --> 53:34.176
Give us some space just for today.

785
53:39.086 --> 53:40.816
All right, fine.

786
54:24.796 --> 54:25.996
Please wait here a moment.

787
54:36.846 --> 54:38.816
Seriously...

788
54:40.046 --> 54:42.216
There really is no one here.

789
54:44.346 --> 54:45.386
That kid...

790
54:46.586 --> 54:47.926
Did he go get a knife?

791
55:04.306 --> 55:05.306
It is the sea bass steak...

792
55:05.776 --> 55:06.976
that you like, Mother.

793
55:22.926 --> 55:23.926
Did you poison it?

794
55:24.896 --> 55:25.926
My plate?

795
55:45.416 --> 55:46.416
Please try.

796
55:46.716 --> 55:48.616
It is your first time trying my cooking, right?

797
56:04.526 --> 56:05.536
Yes.

798
56:08.166 --> 56:09.336
What do you want to do to me?

799
56:10.536 --> 56:11.876
Do you want to strangle me or something?

800
56:12.536 --> 56:14.846
You know matricide carries a much harsher sentence, right?

801
56:25.216 --> 56:26.556
Did you poison the wine?

802
56:35.796 --> 56:36.796
Fine.

803
56:38.336 --> 56:40.096
I lost my mind for a moment.

804
56:41.166 --> 56:43.066
I went too far, I was petty, and I was childish.

805
56:45.276 --> 56:46.276
But...

806
56:47.876 --> 56:51.576
do you really think I did that...

807
56:52.376 --> 56:53.516
just for myself?

808
56:55.446 --> 56:58.086
Do you think I did it for my own wealth and glory?

809
57:14.906 --> 57:18.676
I did it all for you. You!

810
57:20.206 --> 57:22.206
I wanted you to have all the wealth,

811
57:22.806 --> 57:24.576
success, and honour in the world.

812
57:25.276 --> 57:29.246
I wanted you to climb higher than your father or me...

813
57:29.546 --> 57:30.946
so that no one could ever touch you,

814
57:31.016 --> 57:33.416
to be more impressive and extraordinary.

815
57:34.756 --> 57:36.426
I am afraid of heights, Mom.

816
57:37.926 --> 57:39.926
You know that is not what I meant.

817
57:40.196 --> 57:41.596
Still, being a man,

818
57:43.096 --> 57:44.736
I wanted to try overcoming it,

819
57:45.636 --> 57:48.936
so not long ago, I went to the top of a 100-story building.

820
57:49.806 --> 57:50.806
But...

821
57:54.076 --> 57:55.606
I could not breathe,

822
57:56.776 --> 57:58.076
and I almost died.

823
57:59.746 --> 58:01.176
Do you not understand plain English?

824
58:02.786 --> 58:05.686
- Do you not get what I am saying? - I broke out in a cold sweat,

825
58:05.956 --> 58:07.256
had a panic attack,

826
58:08.056 --> 58:10.126
and truly felt like I was at death's door.

827
58:11.126 --> 58:12.596
If there had not been people around,

828
58:13.396 --> 58:15.066
I really might have died.

829
58:20.936 --> 58:22.236
Please, spare me, Mom.

830
58:24.166 --> 58:26.406
Mu Jin!

831
58:26.806 --> 58:27.976
I never...

832
58:30.006 --> 58:32.416
want to climb to the top of that 100-story building again.

833
58:32.816 --> 58:34.646
There is no view I care to see up there.

834
58:35.816 --> 58:36.886
I do not want to throw my life away...

835
58:36.946 --> 58:39.386
so carelessly over some childish bravado.

836
58:42.726 --> 58:44.586
Please spare me, okay?

837
58:45.796 --> 58:46.996
Spare me, Mother.

838
58:48.496 --> 58:51.636
My parents gave me this precious life,

839
58:53.396 --> 58:54.536
and I want to cherish it.

840
58:55.506 --> 58:57.136
Safe and happy,

841
58:58.176 --> 58:59.336
until the end of the world,

842
58:59.406 --> 59:02.006
I really want to live a long, long time.

843
59:03.676 --> 59:04.876
Thank you for bringing me into this world...

844
59:04.946 --> 59:06.016
and raising me all these years.

845
59:06.546 --> 59:08.686
I will spend the rest of my life...

846
59:09.186 --> 59:10.446
repaying you for everything you have done.

847
59:10.886 --> 59:11.886
So please.

848
59:17.886 --> 59:18.996
Just this once.

849
59:21.726 --> 59:22.866
Just this one time.

850
59:25.566 --> 59:27.096
Please spare me just this once, Mother.

851
59:31.306 --> 59:32.336
Please spare me.

852
59:39.576 --> 59:40.616
No...

853
01:00:00.566 --> 01:00:01.736
We are closed.

854
01:00:12.846 --> 01:00:15.116
We are closed, so please leave.

855
01:00:15.946 --> 01:00:17.086
You know Han Gyu Young, right?

856
01:00:22.426 --> 01:00:25.226
Who are you, and how do you know my sister?

857
01:00:26.356 --> 01:00:28.626
I have something to tell you about Han Gyu Young.

858
01:00:29.066 --> 01:00:32.436
Could you spare a moment?

859
01:00:43.006 --> 01:00:45.776
When you go to the market, there is cabbage,

860
01:00:45.846 --> 01:00:48.616
sweet potatoes, and onions

861
01:00:48.686 --> 01:00:50.916
When you go to the market, there is cabbage,

862
01:00:50.986 --> 01:00:52.586
sweet potatoes, and...

863
01:00:53.616 --> 01:00:56.456
What did you say came next?

864
01:00:56.986 --> 01:00:58.326
I am not telling you.

865
01:00:58.396 --> 01:01:01.026
Where is the fun in a game if I just tell you?

866
01:01:01.156 --> 01:01:05.096
You little punk. If you were in Squid Game,

867
01:01:05.396 --> 01:01:07.936
you would sell out your own mother.

868
01:01:08.036 --> 01:01:12.236
Do you think I'm Yang Dong Geun? Even if it kills me,

869
01:01:12.306 --> 01:01:13.736
I would never leave you behind, Mom.

870
01:01:13.936 --> 01:01:16.546
Sure. As if.

871
01:01:16.746 --> 01:01:18.976
What came after sweet potatoes?

872
01:01:19.146 --> 01:01:21.916
You will not even help me out with something so small.

873
01:01:22.616 --> 01:01:23.686
Onions.

874
01:01:24.816 --> 01:01:27.586
Onions, and sweet pancakes.

875
01:01:29.156 --> 01:01:30.686
When you go to the market, there is cabbage,

876
01:01:30.756 --> 01:01:33.796
sweet potatoes, onions, sweet pancakes, and chicken feet.

877
01:01:33.796 --> 01:01:34.796
Oh my.

878
01:01:35.566 --> 01:01:38.836
Look at you, memorizing all that so fast.

879
01:01:38.896 --> 01:01:42.106
Our Gyu Young must be getting all better.

880
01:01:43.066 --> 01:01:45.876
When you go to the market, there is cabbage,

881
01:01:45.936 --> 01:01:48.546
sweet potatoes, onions...

882
01:01:48.606 --> 01:01:50.246
Hold on.

883
01:01:52.076 --> 01:01:53.816
(Song I Guk)

884
01:01:53.876 --> 01:01:56.546
I Guk? Why is I Guk calling?

885
01:01:56.616 --> 01:01:58.886
Something must have happened at the store.

886
01:01:59.186 --> 01:02:01.156
What are you waiting for? Answer it.

887
01:02:01.626 --> 01:02:03.026
Hey, I Guk.

888
01:02:03.856 --> 01:02:05.196
Who?

889
01:02:05.726 --> 01:02:06.726
Gyu Young?

890
01:02:07.726 --> 01:02:10.866
What? She will know if I say PS?

891
01:02:11.736 --> 01:02:12.936
What is PS?

892
01:02:14.866 --> 01:02:16.766
A psycho showed up at Han Gyu Rim's store?

893
01:02:18.906 --> 01:02:22.276
Wait, she left with that psycho?

894
01:02:22.546 --> 01:02:25.176
Where to? Did she say where they were going?

895
01:02:35.726 --> 01:02:37.226
How do you know my sister?

896
01:02:38.226 --> 01:02:40.726
How does a guy like you know our Gyu Young?

897
01:02:43.696 --> 01:02:44.996
"A guy like me?"

898
01:02:57.906 --> 01:02:59.616
What kind of guy is that?

899
01:03:01.646 --> 01:03:02.646
Forget it.

900
01:03:03.316 --> 01:03:04.416
I shouldn't have come with you.

901
01:03:05.156 --> 01:03:07.656
There's no way Gyu Young would know someone like you.

902
01:03:15.566 --> 01:03:17.026
I'm Gyu Young's husband.

903
01:03:19.066 --> 01:03:20.336
Your sister...

904
01:03:20.596 --> 01:03:22.636
screwed over her in-laws and husband...

905
01:03:22.936 --> 01:03:24.306
and walked out on us.

906
01:03:26.306 --> 01:03:28.476
How on earth did you people raise her?

907
01:03:39.916 --> 01:03:41.456
Finally, she's calling.

908
01:03:42.926 --> 01:03:45.026
(Gyu Young)

909
01:03:51.266 --> 01:03:52.266
Honey.

910
01:03:54.396 --> 01:03:55.536
Han Gyu Young!

911
01:03:58.006 --> 01:04:01.536
You crazy, psycho bastard. I'm on my way,

912
01:04:01.606 --> 01:04:03.246
so give me your address right now.

913
01:04:06.476 --> 01:04:10.886
Yes, I'll come alone. I won't bring Jo Heung Sik,

914
01:04:10.946 --> 01:04:13.256
so give me the address right now, you bastard.

915
01:04:15.486 --> 01:04:19.326
You'd better not bring Jo Heung Sik. Try to mess with me again,

916
01:04:20.096 --> 01:04:23.426
and your sister will end up in a casket.

917
01:04:26.166 --> 01:04:27.466
Gyu Young, what's going on?

918
01:04:28.136 --> 01:04:29.566
What's going on with you?

919
01:04:30.066 --> 01:04:31.206
Give me that!

920
01:04:31.606 --> 01:04:33.506
How dare you?

921
01:04:34.576 --> 01:04:36.246
Why did you go with that bastard?

922
01:04:36.576 --> 01:04:38.106
Do you have a death wish?

923
01:04:39.546 --> 01:04:41.546
Get away right now.

924
01:04:42.716 --> 01:04:45.316
That bastard is a total psycho, so run away right now,

925
01:04:45.386 --> 01:04:46.486
Han Gyu Rim!

926
01:05:22.686 --> 01:05:24.586
(Love on the Menu)

927
01:05:24.656 --> 01:05:26.156
Who do you guys think you are?

928
01:05:26.156 --> 01:05:27.856
Why are you meddling in my business?

929
01:05:27.926 --> 01:05:30.266
If I want to see someone ruined in real time,

930
01:05:30.326 --> 01:05:31.426
all I need to do is look in the mirror.

931
01:05:31.496 --> 01:05:34.896
- Mom, what happened to your face? - I'm sorry, Gyu Rim.

932
01:05:34.966 --> 01:05:36.536
Mom is sorry.

933
01:05:37.136 --> 01:05:38.266
I'm so sorry.

934
01:05:38.266 --> 01:05:41.536
Is it because I'm a burden that you said no?

935
01:05:41.636 --> 01:05:42.876
Why would you be a burden?

936
01:05:42.946 --> 01:05:45.776
You know Han Gyeol, right? Han Gyu Rim's son.

937
01:05:46.076 --> 01:05:49.346
I think I am Gyeol's biological father.

938
01:05:49.546 --> 01:05:50.586
What did you say?
